{
  "title": "条目工具栏",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>条目工具栏</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">条目窗口提供了一个工具栏，其中包含用于执行各种任务的按钮。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/itemtoolbar.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">下表描述了条目工具栏中的按钮。</p>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\" width=\"912\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 17.839%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 13.663%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 68.498%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">按钮名称</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">按钮</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">说明</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">创建新条目</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/createnewpart.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">创建一个新条目。按钮名称会根据您要创建的条目类型而变化。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">保存</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/save.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将当前打开的条目保存到服务器。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">更多</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/more.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">点击<strong>更多</strong>按钮可查看上下文菜单。从中可以选择<strong>清除此版本</strong>以删除条目的当前版本，或选择<strong>删除所有版本</strong>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">刷新</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/Logging_off_refresh_icon.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">刷新并重新加载表单上的条目信息。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">导出到 Excel</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">点击<strong>共享</strong>按钮，从上下文菜单中选择<strong>导出到 Excel</strong>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">导出到 Word</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">点击<strong>共享</strong>，将当前打开条目的所有属性和关系属性导出到 Microsoft Word 文档中。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">复制 ID</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">从上下文菜单中选择\"复制 ID\"，将 ID 复制到剪贴板。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">复制链接</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">从上下文菜单中选择\"复制链接\"，将指定链接复制到剪贴板。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">复制链接到</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/share.jpg\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">从上下文菜单中选择\"复制链接到\"，将指定链接复制到最新版本或最新发布版本。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">认领</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/claim.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">认领该条目（进入编辑模式），并阻止其他用户提交更改。有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">认领或取消认领条目</a>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">解锁</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/unclaim.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">取消认领当前打开的条目，允许任何授权用户锁定该条目进行更改。有关更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">认领或取消认领条目</a>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">撤销更改</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/Main_toolbar_undo_icon.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将条目恢复到上次保存时的值。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">提升</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/Main_toolbar_promote_icon.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">将条目提升到分配的生命周期地图中定义的下一个可用状态。有关提升条目的更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">在生命周期中提升条目</a>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">导航</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/navigate.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">点击\"导航\"并从上下文菜单中选择\"版本\"。所选条目的版本信息将显示出来。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">隐藏选项卡视图中的选项卡</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/Main_toolbar_hide_tabs_icon.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">切换关系选项卡的显示状态。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">帮助</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/Main_toolbar_help_icon.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示<span class=\"Italics\">Just Ask Innovator</span>在线帮助。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">完成</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\"></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">保存对条目所做的更改，解锁该条目，然后关闭条目窗口。</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Item_Toolbar.htm"
}